01:02:07,550 --> 01:02:09,320
- No. - What does he look like?

1786
01:02:10,090 --> 01:02:13,120
He looks like a delinquent.

1787
01:02:13,320 --> 01:02:14,759
I guess your friends got good grades.

1788
01:02:14,760 --> 01:02:15,789
All of them got good grades.

1789
01:02:15,790 --> 01:02:18,360
Jae Kang was the vice president in middle school.

1790
01:02:18,560 --> 01:02:20,870
Hyung Jin studied architecture in Seoul National University.

1791
01:02:21,800 --> 01:02:24,370
- Really? - Both Jae Kang and Hyung Jin...

1792
01:02:24,540 --> 01:02:26,299
