1793
01:02:26,300 --> 01:02:27,569
Everyone got good grades except for me.

1794
01:02:27,570 --> 01:02:28,609
How did you befriend them?

1795
01:02:28,610 --> 01:02:30,740
- Smart kids stick together. - It's hard to befriend them.

1796
01:02:30,940 --> 01:02:32,209
- Smart kids stick together. - Isn't that a malicious question?

1797
01:02:32,210 --> 01:02:33,479
"How did you befriend them?"

1798
01:02:33,480 --> 01:02:35,549
But smart kids stick together.

1799
01:02:35,550 --> 01:02:36,649
That's right. It's a reasonable question.

1800
01:02:36,650 --> 01:02:38,549
It couldn't have been easy to befriend them.

1801
01:02:38,550 --> 01:02:39,950
Perhaps Jae Hyeon got good grades as well.

1802
01:02:40,220 --> 01:02:42,050
I received six points on my math exam.

1803
01:02:42,150 --> 01:02:44,059
- Then how... - That takes talent.

1804
01:02:44,060 --> 01:02:45,219
- How did you receive six points? - You need to be smart...

1805
01:02:45,220 --> 01:02:46,389
to receive such a score.

1806
01:02:46,390 --> 01:02:47,989
I bet you were bored...

1807
01:02:47,990 --> 01:02:49,129
- during the exam period. - I loved it.

1808
01:02:49,130 --> 01:02:51,030
- Why? - Weren't your friends busy?

1809
01:02:51,460 --> 01:02:52,929
They studied all the time.

1810
01:02:52,930 --> 01:02:55,830
I mean, when they received a difficult question,

1811
01:02:55,970 --> 01:02:57,169
