1812
01:02:57,170 --> 01:02:59,100
"This one looks fun." They were like that.

1813
01:02:59,240 --> 01:03:01,310
So all three of you enjoyed the exam period.

1814
01:03:01,570 --> 01:03:03,470
- I could go home early. - You liked going home early.

1815
01:03:03,570 --> 01:03:05,739
- Jae Hyeon was excited. - I guess it was possible...

1816
01:03:05,740 --> 01:03:07,679
since they were friends from elementary school.

1817
01:03:07,680 --> 01:03:09,109
We were friends because we remained close.

1818
01:03:09,110 --> 01:03:10,849
You guys bonded over soccer.

1819
01:03:10,850 --> 01:03:13,120
- We liked soccer. - There has to be a common interest.

1820
01:03:13,850 --> 01:03:14,920
Where did you get this photo?

1821
01:03:15,320 --> 01:03:17,490
I printed the Cyworld photos once.

1822
01:03:17,660 --> 01:03:18,660
This is me and this is you.

1823
01:03:18,661 --> 01:03:19,820
That's right.

1824
01:03:20,220 --> 01:03:22,689
That's right. The sticker photos looked like that.

1825
01:03:22,690 --> 01:03:23,930
The colors faded.

1826
01:03:26,230 --> 01:03:27,500
It's from that day.

1827
01:03:27,530 --> 01:03:29,570
- We went to a resort. - We went to a resort.

1828
01:03:29,670 --> 01:03:31,299
