1829
01:03:31,300 --> 01:03:33,640
He has always been handsome.

1830
01:03:35,340 --> 01:03:36,470
These photos bring back memories.

1831
01:03:39,010 --> 01:03:40,639
- Look at this. - Let's look at them again later.

1832
01:03:40,640 --> 01:03:41,780
Sure.

1833
