It's a pencil sharpener.

1835
01:03:47,280 --> 01:03:49,849
- I haven't seen it in a while. - When you sharpen a pencil...

1836
01:03:49,850 --> 01:03:53,090
and smell the pencil dust, it's the best.

1837
01:03:53,290 --> 01:03:54,659
It's an antic.

1838
01:03:54,660 --> 01:03:56,890
- A pencil sharpener. - They don't sell it these days.

1839
