They don't sell big ones. They only sell small ones.

1840
01:04:00,530 --> 01:04:02,270
Jae Kang was the class president.

1841
01:04:02,800 --> 01:04:03,930
That's right.

1842
01:04:04,100 --> 01:04:05,200
He needed something like that.

1843
01:04:06,040 --> 01:04:07,139
Do we need to do a lot of shoveling?

1844
01:04:07,140 --> 01:04:08,640
Is there something we need to help them with?

1845
01:04:08,870 --> 01:04:10,509
Mom and Dad...

1846
01:04:10,510 --> 01:04:13,540
- have an appointment, - Will they head out?

1847
01:04:13,640 --> 01:04:15,310
