1848
01:04:16,510 --> 01:04:20,020
This is your parents' field, right?

1849
01:04:20,620 --> 01:04:23,190
That's what my mom needs help on.

1850
01:04:23,590 --> 01:04:24,690
Do you see the grassy area?

1851
01:04:25,260 --> 01:04:27,390
