She wants us to remove the grass so that she can plant lettuce.

1854
01:04:31,300 --> 01:04:33,500
She wants us to remove rocks and such.

1855
01:04:34,630 --> 01:04:35,969
Jae Kang, I'll go and change.

1856
01:04:35,970 --> 01:04:37,370
Okay. Go and change.

1857
01:04:38,540 --> 01:04:39,870
All right. Let's get started.

1858
01:04:40,370 --> 01:04:41,410
What do we need to do?

1859
