1864
01:04:53,920 --> 01:04:56,549
You see grass from here to there, right?

1865
01:04:56,550 --> 01:04:58,019
- The ditch. - Yes.

1866
01:04:58,020 --> 01:04:59,519
- The cherry blossom tree. - Yes. The ditch.

1867
01:04:59,520 --> 01:05:01,860
We'll turn over the plants and rocks...

1868
01:05:02,130 --> 01:05:03,290
