- What? - It's nothing.

1874
01:05:12,470 --> 01:05:13,870
You're good. That's how you do it.

1875
01:05:16,170 --> 01:05:17,270
Am I doing this right?

1876
01:05:18,580 --> 01:05:19,839
- Here. - Am I doing this right?

1877
01:05:19,840 --> 01:05:21,310
(How do I do it?)

1878
01:05:22,550 --> 01:05:23,680
Dig in the shovel.

1879
01:05:25,520 --> 01:05:26,749
Turn it over like this.

1880
01:05:26,750 --> 01:05:27,920
(Turn over the plants and soil.)

1881
01:05:29,590 --> 01:05:31,759
- I see that Jae Kang is the leader. - That's right.

1882
01:05:31,760 --> 01:05:32,960
