1894
01:05:52,580 --> 01:05:53,839
- Na Rae. - I heard...

1895
01:05:53,840 --> 01:05:55,149
that you did the military support for the civilian authorities.

1896
01:05:55,150 --> 01:05:56,749
I did that many times.

1897
01:05:56,750 --> 01:05:57,819
It was intense...

1898
01:05:57,820 --> 01:05:59,050
