1908
01:06:28,050 --> 01:06:29,449
(Turning)

1909
01:06:29,450 --> 01:06:30,550
- Oh, no. - What was that?

1910
01:06:31,120 --> 01:06:33,080
- Oh, my. - My goodness.

1911
01:06:33,950 --> 01:06:35,050
My goodness.

1912
01:06:35,450 --> 01:06:36,590
Why is it hard?

1913
01:06:36,720 --> 01:06:38,220
- It's hard. - It's hard indeed.

1914
01:06:38,660 --> 01:06:39,790
My back hurts so much.

1915
01:06:40,220 --> 01:06:41,790
Use your legs, not your back.

1916
01:06:42,890 --> 01:06:44,060
That's right. Lower your legs.

1917
01:06:44,230 --> 01:06:45,300
Like this?

1918
01:06:46,430 --> 01:06:47,600
Jae Hyeon.

1919
01:06:48,070 --> 01:06:49,429
Like this,

1920
01:06:49,430 --> 01:06:50,800
use your legs.

1921
01:06:51,240 --> 01:06:53,400
That's how you do it. It'll hurt less.

1922
01:06:55,410 --> 01:06:59,840
(Jae Hyeon does his best.)

1923
01:07:02,080 --> 01:07:03,879
(He's sweating buckets.)

1924
01:07:03,880 --> 01:07:05,249
- Oh, my. - It was so hard.

1925
01:07:05,250 --> 01:07:06,380
Oh, my.

1926
01:07:06,820 --> 01:07:07,990
Oh, my.

1927
01:07:10,920 --> 01:07:12,190
Your legs are shaking already.

1928
01:07:12,920 --> 01:07:14,260
No. It's because I drove a lot.

1929
01:07:15,430 --> 01:07:17,660
Step on it and lift.

1930
01:07:18,500 --> 01:07:19,860
- Turn it over. - That's right.

1931
01:07:21,230 --> 01:07:23,699
- When Jae Hyeon shovels, - Yes?

1932
01:07:23,700 --> 01:07:24,799
it looks strenuous.

1933
01:07:24,800 --> 01:07:26,270
(It looks especially strenuous.)

1934
01:07:27,840 --> 01:07:31,080
I think the muscles you use are different from what others use.

1935
01:07:31,510 --> 01:07:32,610
These muscles are for fashion.

1936
01:07:32,840 --> 01:07:34,780
- My goodness. - These muscles are for fashion.

1937
01:07:35,050 --> 01:07:37,010
Oh, no. He's so weak.

1938
01:07:38,420 --> 01:07:39,750
You're doing well, Jae Hyeon.

1939
01:07:42,420 --> 01:07:44,660
- My goodness. - You're sweating so much.

1940
01:07:45,760 --> 01:07:50,330
(The two dads don't get tired.)

1941
01:07:51,900 --> 01:07:54,230
Look at Jae Hyeon's eyes. He seems sick.

1942
01:07:56,070 --> 01:07:57,899
- Oh, no. - What is he going to do?

1943
01:07:57,900 --> 01:07:59,000
My goodness.

1944
01:07:59,100 --> 01:08:00,439
- I'm exhausted, Jae Kang. - What?

1945
01:08:00,440 --> 01:08:01,570
Good luck.

1946
01:08:04,310 --> 01:08:06,109
(Chuckling)

1947
01:08:06,110 --> 01:08:07,709
What is he going to do?

1948
01:08:07,710 --> 01:08:08,880
(What is Jae Hyeon going to do?)

1949
01:08:11,020 --> 01:08:12,219
He works really hard.

1950
01:08:12,220 --> 01:08:13,279
Doing well isn't important.

1951
01:08:13,280 --> 01:08:15,090
- It's good to see. - Yes. You just need to do it.

1952
01:08:15,250 --> 01:08:16,290
He works hard.

1953
01:08:16,650 --> 01:08:17,959
You still did a lot, Jae Hyeon.

1954
01:08:17,960 --> 01:08:19,620
- He did a lot. - Right.

1955
01:08:21,890 --> 01:08:24,230
(Sweating)

1956
