1963
01:08:38,280 --> 01:08:39,540
- Rio. - Rio.

1964
01:08:40,640 --> 01:08:41,750
Should we take a break?

1965
01:08:43,110 --> 01:08:44,579
Cucumbers are great.

1966
01:08:44,580 --> 01:08:45,979
That was amazing.

1967
01:08:45,980 --> 01:08:47,419
They're great when you need to get hydrated.

1968
01:08:47,420 --> 01:08:48,520
Cucumbers taste great.

1969
