- Right. - Right.

1972
01:08:56,430 --> 01:08:58,329
The older girls came to the classroom for Jae Hyeon.

1973
01:08:58,330 --> 01:09:00,330
- Right. - So that's possible?

1974
01:09:00,760 --> 01:09:02,830
He refused to go out with them,

1975
01:09:03,270 --> 01:09:05,970
