1981
01:09:15,410 --> 01:09:17,109
They called me out during lunch.

1982
01:09:17,110 --> 01:09:18,180
Why?

1983
01:09:18,420 --> 01:09:19,919
They were sitting down just like we are right now.

1984
01:09:19,920 --> 01:09:22,149
I was right in the middle of them.

1985
01:09:22,150 --> 01:09:23,290
"Hey, Ahn Jae Hyeon!" "Yes?"

1986
01:09:24,120 --> 01:09:25,159
They didn't even say anything about wanting to date me.

1987
01:09:25,160 --> 01:09:27,060
Then why did they call you out?

1988
01:09:27,220 --> 01:09:28,989
I was just told to sit in between them.

1989
01:09:28,990 --> 01:09:30,490
That was all that happened.

1990
01:09:30,690 --> 01:09:32,099
I can now talk about this with a smile,

1991
01:09:32,100 --> 01:09:34,200
but they were really scary back then.

1992
01:09:34,230 --> 01:09:35,430
I still feel jealous.

1993
01:09:36,430 --> 01:09:37,430
Right.

1994
01:09:38,470 --> 01:09:40,100
You guys hid behind the curtains.

1995
01:09:40,500 --> 01:09:42,040
I thought it was a joke.

1996
01:09:42,170 --> 01:09:44,339
Being dragged out for a month as a joke?

1997
01:09:44,340 --> 01:09:46,080
How is that possible?

1998
01:09:46,840 --> 01:09:48,609
- The cucumber... - I feel better.

1999
01:09:48,610 --> 01:09:49,850
- charged me up. - Right.

2000
01:09:50,580 --> 01:09:52,080
- We're done. - What?

2001
01:09:52,480 --> 01:09:55,520
Just flatten out that part with your hands.

2002
01:09:55,920 --> 01:09:57,220
