2003
01:09:57,760 --> 01:09:59,319
These are carrot seeds. Place 2 to 3 of them.

2004
01:09:59,320 --> 01:10:01,090
You did a lot of work.

2005
01:10:01,930 --> 01:10:03,030
Those are tomatoes.

2006
01:10:03,460 --> 01:10:04,630
The seedlings for tomatoes.

2007
01:10:05,000 --> 01:10:06,200
Should we meet in winter?

2008
01:10:06,230 --> 01:10:07,630
That sounds good.

2009
01:10:08,030 --> 01:10:09,730
- Let's water them now. - Okay.

2010
01:10:10,000 --> 01:10:11,030
Here.

2011
01:10:12,440 --> 01:10:14,540
