2012
01:10:14,710 --> 01:10:17,739
- It's because he has long legs. - Gosh!

2013
01:10:17,740 --> 01:10:20,409
You'll be great at badminton with that kind of flexibility.

2014
01:10:20,410 --> 01:10:21,610
(He seems to have the talent.)

2015
01:10:22,710 --> 01:10:24,079
(The ground is soft.)

2016
01:10:24,080 --> 01:10:25,149
The ground is soft.

2017
01:10:25,150 --> 01:10:26,350
(That's a relief.)

2018
01:10:27,280 --> 01:10:28,289
What do we do now?

2019
01:10:28,290 --> 01:10:29,920
- Are we done? - We need to water them.

2020
01:10:30,250 --> 01:10:31,760
- Give them a lot of water. - Okay.

2021
01:10:32,260 --> 01:10:33,460
That's good.

2022
01:10:33,860 --> 01:10:34,960
The water is coming out well.

2023
01:10:35,260 --> 01:10:37,530
- That's perfect. - It can be controlled.

2024
01:10:38,100 --> 01:10:39,160
You're doing well.

2025
01:10:40,600 --> 01:10:42,600
- How am I doing? - You're doing well.

2026
01:10:44,200 --> 01:10:45,300
Are you two really friends?

2027
01:10:46,070 --> 01:10:47,140
Hold on.

2028
01:10:47,200 --> 01:10:49,039
After he became a father,

2029
01:10:49,040 --> 01:10:50,439
- he changed. - Right.

2030
01:10:50,440 --> 01:10:52,540
- He changed. - Fathers speak differently.

2031
01:10:52,840 --> 01:10:55,109
(You're doing well, my Jae Hyeon.)

2032
01:10:55,110 --> 01:10:56,780
(Feeling proud)

2033
01:10:58,120 --> 01:10:59,980
There you go. Use your tall height.

2034
01:11:00,480 --> 01:11:01,489
Great.

2035
01:11:01,490 --> 01:11:02,620
That's enough. Done!

2036
01:11:03,820 --> 01:11:04,859
Let's eat.

2037
01:11:04,860 --> 01:11:06,019
- We're done? - We're done.

2038
01:11:06,020 --> 01:11:07,760
- We need to make a fire. - We do.

2039
01:11:08,430 --> 01:11:09,560
How should it be done?

2040
